<!doctype html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Bảng tuần hoàn hóa học 3D</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #071019;
      --panel: rgba(13, 26, 38, .78);
      --panel-2: rgba(21, 36, 50, .92);
      --text: #eef7ff;
      --muted: #9cb7c9;
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,.13);
      --accent: #43e3c5;
      --accent-2: #ffcc66;
      --danger: #ff6b8b;
      --shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.36);
      --radius: 8px;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    [data-theme="light"] {
      --bg: #f4f8fb;
      --panel: rgba(255,255,255,.88);
      --panel-2: #ffffff;
      --text: #10202d;
      --muted: #526b7b;
      --line: rgba(16,32,45,.14);
      --shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(27,56,77,.14);
    }

    [data-theme="glass"] {
      --bg: #0a1422;
      --panel: rgba(255,255,255,.13);
      --panel-2: rgba(255,255,255,.17);
      --text: #f5fbff;
      --muted: #b9ccdc;
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,.22);
      --accent: #a7f3d0;
      --accent-2: #f9a8d4;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 12% 8%, rgba(67,227,197,.18), transparent 32%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 82% 18%, rgba(255,204,102,.18), transparent 32%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg), #0b1320 58%, #111827);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,.35) 1px, transparent 1.5px),
        radial-gradient(circle, rgba(67,227,197,.28) 1px, transparent 1.5px);
      background-size: 78px 78px, 127px 127px;
      animation: drift 28s linear infinite;
      opacity: .27;
      z-index: -1;
    }

    @keyframes drift {
      from { transform: translate3d(0,0,0); }
      to { transform: translate3d(-70px, 70px, 0); }
    }

    .app-shell {
      width: min(1500px, calc(100% - 28px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 20;
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg), transparent 18%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .nav {
      min-height: 68px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      position: relative;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-2), #ff745e 48%, transparent 51%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(67,227,197,.5);
    }

    .brand-mark::before,
    .brand-mark::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 9px -9px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      transform: rotate(32deg);
    }

    .brand-mark::after { transform: rotate(-32deg); }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scrollbar-width: none;
      padding: 8px 0;
    }

    nav::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    nav a, .btn, .chip, .icon-btn, select, input {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--panel);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    nav a {
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      font-size: 14px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    nav a:hover, .btn:hover, .chip:hover, .icon-btn:hover {
      border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent), white 15%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(67,227,197,.12);
    }

    .theme-select {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      outline: none;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: calc(100vh - 68px);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(320px, 520px);
      gap: 34px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 46px 0 24px;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 92px);
      line-height: .94;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .lead {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 22px);
      line-height: 1.55;
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .hero-actions, .tool-row, .filter-row, .compare-grid, .profile-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .btn {
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .btn.primary {
      color: #05201b;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #8cffb6);
      border-color: transparent;
    }

    .search-box {
      width: min(680px, 100%);
      margin: 26px 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    input, select {
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: 0 12px;
      outline: none;
      font: inherit;
    }

    .atom-stage {
      min-height: 460px;
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      perspective: 900px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .atom {
      width: min(72vw, 390px);
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      position: relative;
      transform-style: preserve-3d;
      animation: floaty 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .nucleus {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 38%;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 34% 30%, #fff, var(--accent-2) 24%, #ff5b66 66%, #8b1e49);
      box-shadow: 0 0 55px rgba(255,204,102,.75), inset -12px -14px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
    }

    .orbit {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 10%;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);
      border-radius: 50%;
      transform-style: preserve-3d;
      animation: spin 5s linear infinite;
    }

    .orbit:nth-child(2) { transform: rotateX(68deg) rotateY(24deg); animation-duration: 4.2s; }
    .orbit:nth-child(3) { transform: rotateX(-58deg) rotateY(62deg); animation-duration: 6.5s; }
    .orbit:nth-child(4) { transform: rotateX(10deg) rotateY(84deg); animation-duration: 7.5s; }

    .electron {
      width: 15px;
      height: 15px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 24px var(--accent);
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      top: -8px;
    }

    @keyframes spin { to { rotate: 360deg; } }
    @keyframes floaty {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotateX(8deg); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-16px) rotateX(-6deg); }
    }

    section {
      padding: 54px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .section-title {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 50px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .muted { color: var(--muted); }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .panel {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }

    .pad { padding: 18px; }
    .span-3 { grid-column: span 3; }
    .span-4 { grid-column: span 4; }
    .span-5 { grid-column: span 5; }
    .span-6 { grid-column: span 6; }
    .span-7 { grid-column: span 7; }
    .span-8 { grid-column: span 8; }
    .span-12 { grid-column: span 12; }

    .timeline {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(8, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .time-card {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      min-height: 150px;
    }

    .time-card strong {
      color: var(--accent-2);
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .periodic-wrap {
      overflow: auto;
      padding: 12px;
    }

    .periodic {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(18, 72px);
      grid-auto-rows: 72px;
      gap: 6px;
      min-width: 1398px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .element {
      position: relative;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform .16s ease, filter .16s ease, opacity .16s ease;
      color: #061015;
    }

    .element:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.06);
      z-index: 2;
      filter: saturate(1.25) brightness(1.08);
    }

    .element.dim { opacity: .2; }
    .num { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; opacity: .76; }
    .sym { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 950; line-height: 1.05; }
    .ename { font-size: 9px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
    .mass { font-size: 8px; opacity: .8; }

    .alkali { background: #ff9d8e; }
    .alkaline { background: #ffd36a; }
    .transition { background: #86d9ff; }
    .post-transition { background: #9ee8b7; }
    .metalloid { background: #bba8ff; }
    .nonmetal { background: #a8f0df; }
    .halogen { background: #f8a8dc; }
    .noble { background: #b8d2ff; }
    .lanthanide { background: #ffbd7a; }
    .actinide { background: #f0a1a8; }
    .unknown { background: #d6dde4; }

    .legend {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .legend-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .swatch {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);
    }

    .detail-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 290px 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .big-symbol {
      height: 260px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      color: #061015;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a8f0df, #ffd36a);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .big-symbol b { font-size: 96px; display: block; }
    .facts {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .fact {
      background: var(--panel-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 12px;
      min-height: 74px;
    }

    .fact small { color: var(--muted); display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .mini-atom {
      height: 280px;
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .particle {
      position: absolute;
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #061015;
    }

    .p { background: #ff6b8b; }
    .n { background: #ffd36a; transform: translate(22px, -12px); }
    .e { background: #43e3c5; animation: electronPath 4s linear infinite; }
    .e.two { animation-delay: -2s; }
    @keyframes electronPath {
      from { transform: rotate(0deg) translateX(115px) rotate(0deg); }
      to { transform: rotate(360deg) translateX(115px) rotate(-360deg); }
    }

    .bars { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    .bar label {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .track {
      height: 12px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border-radius: 99px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .fill {
      height: 100%;
      width: var(--w);
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2), var(--danger));
    }

    .quiz-option {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: left;
      margin-top: 8px;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .game-board {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .card-tile {
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: var(--panel-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      font-weight: 900;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .reaction {
      font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 44px);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 26px 12px;
      color: var(--accent-2);
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .modal {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      display: none;
      place-items: center;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,.58);
      z-index: 40;
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .modal.open { display: grid; }
    .modal-card {
      width: min(920px, 100%);
      max-height: 88vh;
      overflow: auto;
      background: var(--panel-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .modal-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      background: var(--panel-2);
    }

    .close {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1000px) {
      .hero, .detail-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .atom-stage { min-height: 360px; }
      .span-3, .span-4, .span-5, .span-6, .span-7, .span-8 { grid-column: span 12; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .nav { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }
      nav { grid-column: 1 / -1; order: 3; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 620px) {
      .app-shell { width: min(100% - 18px, 1500px); }
      .search-box { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .periodic { grid-template-columns: repeat(18, 58px); grid-auto-rows: 58px; min-width: 1146px; }
      .sym { font-size: 18px; }
      .ename, .mass { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body data-theme="space">
  <header>
    <div class="app-shell nav">
      <div class="brand">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Hóa Học 118</span>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Điều hướng chính">
        <a href="#home">Trang chủ</a>
        <a href="#history">Lịch sử</a>
        <a href="#table">Bảng tuần hoàn</a>
        <a href="#detail">Nguyên tố</a>
        <a href="#atom3d">Cấu tạo</a>
        <a href="#trends">Quy luật</a>
        <a href="#compare">So sánh</a>
        <a href="#ai">AI Hóa học</a>
        <a href="#quiz">Quiz</a>
        <a href="#games">Trò chơi</a>
        <a href="#lab">Thí nghiệm</a>
        <a href="#forum">Diễn đàn</a>
      </nav>
      <select class="theme-select" id="themeSelect" aria-label="Chọn giao diện">
        <option value="space">Space</option>
        <option value="dark">Dark</option>
        <option value="light">Light</option>
        <option value="glass">Glass</option>
      </select>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="app-shell">
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div>
        <span class="badge">Web học hóa học tương tác</span>
        <h1>Bảng tuần hoàn hóa học phiên bản siêu chi tiết</h1>
        <p class="lead">Khám phá 118 nguyên tố, mô hình nguyên tử chuyển động, bộ lọc theo nhóm - chu kỳ, chi tiết từng nguyên tố, quiz, phòng thí nghiệm ảo, thư viện phản ứng và khu AI hỗ trợ học tập.</p>
        <div class="search-box">
          <input id="globalSearch" placeholder="Tìm Hydrogen, H, số 1, khí hiếm, halogen..." autocomplete="off">
          <button class="btn primary" id="searchBtn">Tìm kiếm</button>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="#table">Bắt đầu</a>
          <a class="btn" href="#detail">Khám phá nguyên tố</a>
          <a class="btn" href="#ai">Mở AI Hóa học</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="atom-stage" aria-label="Hiệu ứng nguyên tử 3D">
        <div class="atom">
          <div class="nucleus"></div>
          <div class="orbit"><span class="electron"></span></div>
          <div class="orbit"><span class="electron"></span></div>
          <div class="orbit"><span class="electron"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="history">
      <div class="section-title">
        <div>
          <h2>Lịch sử bảng tuần hoàn</h2>
          <p class="muted">Từ thuyết nguyên tử của Dalton đến chuẩn danh pháp hiện đại của IUPAC.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline" id="timeline"></div>
    </section>

    <section id="table">
      <div class="section-title">
        <div>
          <h2>Bảng tuần hoàn tương tác</h2>
          <p class="muted">Hover để phóng to, click để mở chi tiết. Có đủ 118 nguyên tố với màu theo loại.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel pad">
        <div class="filter-row">
          <select id="categoryFilter" aria-label="Lọc theo loại">
            <option value="all">Tất cả loại</option>
            <option value="alkali">Kim loại kiềm</option>
            <option value="alkaline">Kim loại kiềm thổ</option>
            <option value="transition">Kim loại chuyển tiếp</option>
            <option value="post-transition">Kim loại sau chuyển tiếp</option>
            <option value="metalloid">Á kim</option>
            <option value="nonmetal">Phi kim</option>
            <option value="halogen">Halogen</option>
            <option value="noble">Khí hiếm</option>
            <option value="lanthanide">Lantan</option>
            <option value="actinide">Actini</option>
          </select>
          <select id="periodFilter" aria-label="Lọc theo chu kỳ">
            <option value="all">Tất cả chu kỳ</option>
          </select>
          <select id="groupFilter" aria-label="Lọc theo nhóm">
            <option value="all">Tất cả nhóm</option>
          </select>
          <button class="btn" id="resetFilters">Đặt lại</button>
        </div>
        <div class="legend" id="legend"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="periodic-wrap panel" style="margin-top:14px">
        <div class="periodic" id="periodicTable"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="detail">
      <div class="section-title">
        <div>
          <h2>Trang chi tiết nguyên tố</h2>
          <p class="muted">Mẫu đang hiển thị theo nguyên tố được chọn trên bảng.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-layout">
        <div class="panel pad">
          <div class="big-symbol" id="bigSymbol"></div>
          <div class="tool-row" style="margin-top:12px">
            <button class="btn" id="prevElement">Trước</button>
            <button class="btn primary" id="nextElement">Tiếp</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel pad">
          <h3 id="detailName"></h3>
          <p class="muted" id="detailIntro"></p>
          <div class="facts" id="facts"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="atom3d">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="span-5 panel pad">
          <h2>Mô hình nguyên tử 3D</h2>
          <p class="muted">Electron chuyển động quanh hạt nhân, có proton, neutron và electron. Trong bản đầy đủ có thể thay CSS animation bằng Three.js để xoay và zoom thật.</p>
          <div class="profile-row">
            <span class="badge">Proton</span>
            <span class="badge">Neutron</span>
            <span class="badge">Electron</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="span-7 panel mini-atom">
          <div class="particle p">p+</div>
          <div class="particle n">n</div>
          <div class="particle e">e-</div>
          <div class="particle e two">e-</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="electron">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="span-4 panel pad">
          <h2>Cấu hình electron</h2>
          <p class="muted">Ví dụ cấu hình có animation theo lớp orbital.</p>
          <h3 id="electronConfig">1s1</h3>
        </div>
